  <item>
    <title>vol007不上大学创业做综艺式旅行，不给自己设限的人生到底有多爽！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66a900f533ddcbb53c3094e2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66a900f533ddcbb53c3094e2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 30 Jul 2024 15:04:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【简介】</span></p><span></span><p><span>放弃日本留学机会创业，买下一台五手小车环游中国</span></p><span></span><p><span>她身上总有异于常人的过不被定义的人生的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span>创业初期经历了一次又一次考验和诱惑，但是她依旧保持初心</span></p><span></span><p><span>她的创业理念总会让我热泪盈眶</span></p><span></span><p><span>为了保持这份初心，她竟然拒绝了两次被资方投资</span></p><span></span><p><span>她说“不要为生存而恐惧，要为爱而努力”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这就是妙妙——超会玩的00后&amp;“妙游记”主理人</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgk1K7QMUtPYXpvtCbIqE8P-ugOc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【摘要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">00:12:25</a> 因为我文凭没有可比性，就一定要有别的东西去比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">00:19:57</a> 我不怕当那个别人说的所谓的韭菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">00:23:42</a> 这个世界是一个大超市，它的本质是交换</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1596">00:26:36</a> 他人亏欠你的，有时候老天会来奖赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1684">00:28:04</a> 只有转念，你才能感觉这一切都是老天送的礼物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2145">00:35:45</a> 环游中国真的不贵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">00:37:30</a> 家里人不是不支持你，而是你还不够让他们信任你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3301">00:55:01</a> 不要为生存而恐惧，要为爱而努力</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【主播】</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>可乐：资深人力资源从业者/全球职业生涯规划师</span></p><span></span><p><span>星期天：前媒体人/广告人</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>【姐妹听友群】</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>微信：excellent-1112（注明听众）</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：jojgrowup@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
